# 0c_temple_hall (layers 2 3): Splinters u048a u046e. Wake them, then let them fight a god-mode player, hurt and kill them.
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/splinter.py <out> 3bfa3eff,0c_temple_hall --con <this> --fast --frames 3400
@f300 god 1; give missile 50; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; fastmorph 1
@f302 layer 2; layer 3
@f305 send u048a Activate; send u046e Activate
@f310 tp 230 105 -33
@f330 send u048a Alert; send u046e Alert
@f1200 obj u048a; obj u046e
@f2200 damage u048a 2; damage u046e 2
@f2500 damage u048a 2 kb; damage u046e 2 kb
@f2800 damage u048a 20 missile; damage u046e 20 missile
@f3300 objs Splinter
